#: d3d1364dd83f4785b045166715184db1
msgid ""
"In addition to STD and CTR versions, there are older variants called -AIO "
"and -OSD that have been declared end-of-life by Mateksys.  Both use the "
"ICM20602 IMU, like the STD version. Neither have an onboard barometer. While"
" the -AIO has I2C pads exposed, the -OSD version does not."
msgstr ""
"除 STD 和 CTR 版本外，还有较旧的 -AIO 和 -OSD 变体，Mateksys 已宣布这两款停产。两者均使用与 STD 版本相同的 "
"ICM20602 IMU，均无机载气压计。-AIO 具有外露的 I2C 焊盘，而 -OSD 版本没有。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:65 46c6897802f84003aad4bf840e29c261
#: 5fe26ec7cd6f453ebbb917e6f39455e5 8ccfdd49f61046d6a24568b08b936ff6
#: 928779985e4749f68e49a2844f10b48b f16f8a44d3664562a92daaeefe61d641
#: f370414162924073b4f2aa292d52a86f
msgid ""
"For the -STD version please use the MatekF405-STD type firmware. For the "
"-CTR version with MPU6000 please use the MatekF405 type firmware. For the "
":ref:`MatekF405-Wing <common-matekf405-wing>` which has an essentially "
"different board layout please use the dedicated firmware. Please note that "
"ArduPilot does not support -AIO and -OSD versions per default as additional "
"hardware and / or software adjustments are required."
msgstr ""
"-STD 版本请使用 MatekF405-STD 型固件；搭载 MPU6000 的 -CTR 版本请使用 MatekF405 型固件；板型布局基本不同的"
" :ref:`MatekF405-Wing <common-matekf405-wing>` 请使用专用固件。请注意，ArduPilot 默认不支持 "
"-AIO 和 -OSD 版本，因为这两款需要额外的硬件和/或软件调整。"

