"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 必须设为 「23」，并且："

