msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:106 9a95fef4c4a842d88f7d4995526520ff
#: a4178f1ee8504c8cb7f96890f1c94612 a5e3baa349ed44eab4ed47c0cd250522
#: afe9ca9c89074a82a87e04779a5a6bb6 b260ed4323bf481e947078b84be6bd21
#: ebf9ad46a1a84e79b964f931ba0ade6e
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1, 2/3/4, 5, 6, and 7 (-STD only)."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但在同一组内混用 DShot 和普通 PWM 受到限制，即在某组内为某输出启用 "
"DShot，则该组所有输出均须配置并使用 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须使用相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1、2/3/4、5、6 以及 7（仅 -STD）。"

